{"url": "（本地文件）033、第二十九节：握家庭成员称谓词汇，能描述基础家庭关系.mp4", "link": false, "lang": "zh", "local_path": "G:\\【瑞杰老师】全能英语课程\\瑞杰老师 30 天英语实战训练营(1)\\033、第二十九节：握家庭成员称谓词汇，能描述基础家庭关系.mp4", "segments": [{"start": 12.7, "text": "欢迎来到Lesson 29。", "end": 15.14}, {"start": 15.5, "text": "我现在语书加快了,没有那么多的指示了。", "end": 20.54}, {"start": 20.54, "text": "开始跟你们直接讲英语了。", "end": 23.49}, {"start": 23.49, "text": "在Lesson 21到Lesson 28,", "end": 29.93}, {"start": 29.93, "text": "一路从21到28,", "end": 33.41}, {"start": 33.41, "text": "我们在厨房,", "end": 39.72}, {"start": 39.76, "text": "我们在煮食的时候,", "end": 41.76}, {"start": 41.76, "text": "我们看了很多类似的东西,", "end": 45.36}, {"start": 45.36, "text": "例如食物,", "end": 46.96}, {"start": 46.96, "text": "例如动物,对吧?", "end": 50.06}, {"start": 50.06, "text": "我们也谈谈不同的东西,", "end": 56.18}, {"start": 56.18, "text": "也谈谈一样的东西,", "end": 59.42}, {"start": 59.42, "text": "我们也谈谈把苹果从树上取出来,", "end": 66.3}, {"start": 66.3, "text": "我们也谈谈把苹果切成小块,", "end": 71.96}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "我们也谈谈水,", "end": 74.56}, {"start": 74.56, "text": "它是怎么煮的,", "end": 76.64}, {"start": 76.64, "text": "当水中有火,", "end": 81.33}, {"start": 81.33, "text": "我们也谈谈植物,", "end": 85.1}, {"start": 85.1, "text": "它们有花,", "end": 86.9}, {"start": 86.9, "text": "叶子,", "end": 88.22}, {"start": 88.22, "text": "叶子,", "end": 89.46}, {"start": 89.46, "text": "叶子,", "end": 90.86}, {"start": 90.86, "text": "树,", "end": 92.97}, {"start": 92.97, "text": "我们也谈谈不同种类的果物,", "end": 96.73}, {"start": 96.73, "text": "例如苹果和苹果,", "end": 100.19}, {"start": 100.19, "text": "我们也谈谈不同种类的动物,", "end": 103.47}, {"start": 103.47, "text": "例如马和狗,", "end": 107.15}, {"start": 107.15, "text": "我们也谈谈很多种类的东西,", "end": 111.61}, {"start": 111.61, "text": "现在,在第28课,", "end": 114.65}, {"start": 114.65, "text": "我们将谈谈人类一点,", "end": 120.05}, {"start": 120.05, "text": "在第30课之前,", "end": 128.54}, {"start": 128.54, "text": "我刚刚用的所有词基本都是你们学过的,", "end": 132.18}, {"start": 132.18, "text": "你平时觉得瑞杰老师讲话高大上听不懂,", "end": 135.86}, {"start": 135.86, "text": "到现在开始你应该说,", "end": 138.02}, {"start": 138.02, "text": "我大概知道你的意思了,", "end": 140.74}, {"start": 140.74, "text": "你们的听力能力也到了,", "end": 142.98}, {"start": 142.98, "text": "给自己一点空间跟时间,", "end": 146.98}, {"start": 146.98, "text": "现在,在第28课,", "end": 149.94}, {"start": 149.94, "text": "我们将谈谈人类和家庭,", "end": 157.66}, {"start": 157.66, "text": "这是在进入最后第30节的大汇总之前的一个,", "end": 162.82}, {"start": 162.82, "text": "这个最后一个专题,", "end": 165.22}, {"start": 165.22, "text": "这个专题我们在前面的课程里有接触过,", "end": 169.38}, {"start": 169.38, "text": "但是当时我们没有深入到家庭成员,", "end": 172.98}, {"start": 172.98, "text": "我们只是稍微根据那个Picture of my family,", "end": 177.3}, {"start": 177.3, "text": "记得吧,大概是Lesson 6还是Lesson 5的时候,", "end": 182.5}, {"start": 182.5, "text": "有一个Frame,", "end": 184.26}, {"start": 184.26, "text": "In the frame was a picture of a family,", "end": 188.98}, {"start": 188.98, "text": "那个时候我们是不是有稍微介绍过自己家庭的成员跟顺序,", "end": 194.42}, {"start": 194.5, "text": "今天我们针对这个话题做一次回顾,", "end": 197.7}, {"start": 197.7, "text": "跟上次不一样的是,", "end": 199.3}, {"start": 199.3, "text": "这一次我们要干嘛整体说,", "end": 201.94}, {"start": 201.94, "text": "整体阅读,", "end": 203.06}, {"start": 203.06, "text": "整体去应对类似的话题了,", "end": 206.1}, {"start": 206.1, "text": "而不是碎片的讲几个词,", "end": 209.3}, {"start": 209.3, "text": "Here we go,", "end": 210.18}, {"start": 210.18, "text": "Here are a woman and a boy,", "end": 215.06}, {"start": 215.06, "text": "他们离瑞杰老师很近,", "end": 216.66}, {"start": 216.66, "text": "So we say here are a woman and a boy,", "end": 220.74}, {"start": 220.74, "text": "能不能说Here is a woman and a boy,", "end": 223.22}, {"start": 223.22, "text": "这里他们把它视为两个个体,", "end": 225.54}, {"start": 225.54, "text": "A woman and a boy,", "end": 227.54}, {"start": 227.54, "text": "所以用了复数的R,", "end": 229.54}, {"start": 229.54, "text": "The boy is the woman's son,", "end": 233.33}, {"start": 233.33, "text": "The boy is the woman's son,", "end": 238.77}, {"start": 238.77, "text": "注意一撇S,", "end": 240.29}, {"start": 240.29, "text": "说明是女人的一个东西,", "end": 243.01}, {"start": 243.01, "text": "Son,", "end": 244.05}, {"start": 244.05, "text": "那显然是他儿子,", "end": 245.73}, {"start": 245.73, "text": "She is his mother,", "end": 251.41}, {"start": 251.41, "text": "他的妈妈,", "end": 252.77}, {"start": 252.85, "text": "你看,", "end": 253.41}, {"start": 253.41, "text": "这次开始我们就要用这些东西了,", "end": 256.45}, {"start": 256.45, "text": "He is her son,", "end": 261.71}, {"start": 261.71, "text": "我们一直说is如果要化成一个符号,", "end": 264.51}, {"start": 264.51, "text": "就是等号,", "end": 266.19}, {"start": 266.19, "text": "他等于他的儿子,", "end": 268.03}, {"start": 268.03, "text": "就是他是他的儿子,", "end": 269.63}, {"start": 269.63, "text": "这是对他存在状态的一个确认,", "end": 273.07}, {"start": 273.07, "text": "He is her son,", "end": 274.59}, {"start": 274.59, "text": "The girl is the woman's daughter,", "end": 277.63}, {"start": 277.63, "text": "相对于son就有一个daughter,", "end": 280.91}, {"start": 280.91, "text": "This is my son,", "end": 282.35}, {"start": 282.35, "text": "This is my daughter,", "end": 283.71}, {"start": 283.71, "text": "我们平时给别人介绍自己的孩子,", "end": 286.43}, {"start": 286.43, "text": "也是这些英语词汇,", "end": 288.67}, {"start": 288.67, "text": "The woman is her mother,", "end": 291.44}, {"start": 291.44, "text": "能不能说妈咪也可以,", "end": 293.6}, {"start": 293.6, "text": "妈咪比较亲近一点,", "end": 295.52}, {"start": 295.52, "text": "Mother是正式的说法,", "end": 297.68}, {"start": 297.68, "text": "就像母亲跟妈妈的差别,", "end": 299.84}, {"start": 299.84, "text": "Here are a man and his son,", "end": 302.16}, {"start": 302.16, "text": "那爸爸出来了,", "end": 304.16}, {"start": 304.16, "text": "Here are a man and his son,", "end": 307.39}, {"start": 307.39, "text": "The man is the father of the boy,", "end": 310.19}, {"start": 310.27, "text": "Father也出来了,", "end": 312.27}, {"start": 312.27, "text": "能不能说Daddy也可以,", "end": 315.23}, {"start": 315.23, "text": "He is the boy's father,", "end": 318.03}, {"start": 318.03, "text": "He is the boy's father,", "end": 321.95}, {"start": 321.95, "text": "Here are a man and his daughter,", "end": 325.79}, {"start": 325.79, "text": "Here are a man and his daughter,", "end": 329.87}, {"start": 329.87, "text": "He is the father of the girl,", "end": 332.99}, {"start": 332.99, "text": "He is the girl's father,", "end": 335.55}, {"start": 335.55, "text": "She is his daughter,", "end": 338.14}, {"start": 338.14, "text": "He is her father,", "end": 339.98}, {"start": 340.06, "text": "She is his father,", "end": 342.06}, {"start": 342.06, "text": "这里其实是一次很重要的", "end": 345.1}, {"start": 345.1, "text": "对什么代词的最后一次复习跟巩固,", "end": 348.94}, {"start": 348.94, "text": "你们有没有发现", "end": 350.78}, {"start": 350.78, "text": "He is his father,", "end": 352.78}, {"start": 352.78, "text": "He作为主语的时候指的是男人,", "end": 355.58}, {"start": 355.58, "text": "当然He is the girl's father,", "end": 358.3}, {"start": 358.3, "text": "She is his daughter,", "end": 360.3}, {"start": 360.3, "text": "She作为主语的时候也是She,", "end": 363.26}, {"start": 363.26, "text": "对吧,", "end": 364.46}, {"start": 364.46, "text": "但是如果我们反过来说,", "end": 366.62}, {"start": 366.62, "text": "Her father is he,", "end": 369.42}, {"start": 369.5, "text": "可以这么说吗,", "end": 370.62}, {"start": 370.62, "text": "不行,", "end": 371.18}, {"start": 371.18, "text": "对吧,", "end": 371.98}, {"start": 371.98, "text": "Her father is him,", "end": 375.74}, {"start": 375.74, "text": "His daughter is her,", "end": 378.8}, {"start": 378.8, "text": "him跟her就出来了,", "end": 380.96}, {"start": 380.96, "text": "所以最基础的一些代词,", "end": 383.2}, {"start": 383.2, "text": "你们要稍微有概念了,", "end": 384.64}, {"start": 384.64, "text": "要注意去区分,", "end": 386.24}, {"start": 386.24, "text": "就像Me and you,", "end": 388.08}, {"start": 388.08, "text": "是不是,", "end": 389.97}, {"start": 389.97, "text": "所有的这些都要去注意了,", "end": 392.37}, {"start": 392.37, "text": "好,", "end": 393.25}, {"start": 393.25, "text": "那当然这里是一次对家庭的总结,", "end": 395.89}, {"start": 395.89, "text": "我们顺着这个顺序继续往前看,", "end": 399.01}, {"start": 399.01, "text": "Here we go,", "end": 399.81}, {"start": 399.81, "text": "The boy is the brother of the girl,", "end": 402.93}, {"start": 402.93, "text": "那我们现在探讨的是什么,", "end": 405.25}, {"start": 405.25, "text": "兄妹的关系,", "end": 406.69}, {"start": 406.69, "text": "所以刚刚可能是父母,", "end": 408.61}, {"start": 408.61, "text": "Father and mother,", "end": 410.05}, {"start": 410.05, "text": "And their daughter and son,", "end": 412.45}, {"start": 412.45, "text": "Right,", "end": 413.17}, {"start": 413.17, "text": "Now daughter and son之间的关系怎么表述,", "end": 416.61}, {"start": 416.61, "text": "The boy is the brother of the girl,", "end": 419.33}, {"start": 419.33, "text": "He is her brother,", "end": 421.01}, {"start": 421.01, "text": "She is his sister,", "end": 424.53}, {"start": 424.53, "text": "He is the girl's brother,", "end": 426.77}, {"start": 426.77, "text": "He is her brother,", "end": 428.45}, {"start": 428.45, "text": "Brother, sister,", "end": 430.21}, {"start": 430.21, "text": "那这里就要注意了,", "end": 431.81}, {"start": 431.81, "text": "很多中国人有个观念就是哥哥弟弟,", "end": 434.93}, {"start": 434.93, "text": "对吧,", "end": 435.73}, {"start": 435.73, "text": "在英语里会用一个前綴来去解释这个差异,", "end": 440.69}, {"start": 440.69, "text": "一般就是范子兄弟,", "end": 442.53}, {"start": 442.53, "text": "Brother,", "end": 443.01}, {"start": 443.01, "text": "范子姐妹,", "end": 443.97}, {"start": 443.97, "text": "Sister,", "end": 445.01}, {"start": 445.01, "text": "如果我们要说一个人比自己大,", "end": 447.49}, {"start": 447.49, "text": "譬如自己的兄长,", "end": 448.93}, {"start": 448.93, "text": "兄弟,", "end": 449.81}, {"start": 449.81, "text": "兄,", "end": 450.69}, {"start": 450.69, "text": "那就是older brother,", "end": 453.33}, {"start": 453.33, "text": "老一点的brother,", "end": 454.93}, {"start": 454.93, "text": "如果是小一点的,", "end": 456.05}, {"start": 456.05, "text": "那就是little brother,", "end": 458.37}, {"start": 458.37, "text": "或者young brother,", "end": 459.73}, {"start": 460.69, "text": "所以他会用年龄区分,", "end": 463.25}, {"start": 463.25, "text": "相对自己的年龄区分,", "end": 465.41}, {"start": 465.41, "text": "比我老的跟比我年轻的去区分大家,", "end": 469.17}, {"start": 469.17, "text": "只是英语对这个事情的处理也好,", "end": 472.69}, {"start": 472.69, "text": "不会那么难记,", "end": 473.81}, {"start": 473.81, "text": "你敢相信英语要是有像中文那样子,", "end": 477.25}, {"start": 477.25, "text": "每一个亲戚都有自己的字或者词,", "end": 480.85}, {"start": 480.85, "text": "那英语有多难学这些代词吗,", "end": 483.89}, {"start": 483.89, "text": "就怕每个词还有组合并格,", "end": 486.69}, {"start": 486.69, "text": "那就完蛋了,", "end": 487.81}, {"start": 487.81, "text": "Right,", "end": 488.29}, {"start": 488.37, "text": "所以总体说还是比较简单的,", "end": 491.17}, {"start": 490.67, "text": "这里是普通话的句子，", "end": 513.97}, {"start": 513.84, "text": "这里已经开始探讨他们之间的关系了,", "end": 516.8}, {"start": 513.97, "text": "這裡", "end": 514.47}, {"start": 516.8, "text": "不像我们早期探讨的时候,", "end": 518.64}, {"start": 518.64, "text": "只是一些词汇,", "end": 520.16}, {"start": 520.16, "text": "跟he is a boy,", "end": 521.52}, {"start": 521.52, "text": "she is a girl,", "end": 522.56}, {"start": 522.56, "text": "这种很简单的片段,", "end": 525.2}, {"start": 525.2, "text": "现在是全文相互空间关系,", "end": 529.92}, {"start": 529.92, "text": "这些都出来了,", "end": 530.96}, {"start": 530.46, "text": "这男子和这女子有两个儿子﹔这男子和这女子有两个儿子﹔他们有两个儿子﹔他们有三个儿子﹔他们有五个儿子﹔孩子﹔孩子。", "end": 555.46}, {"start": 554.85, "text": "child是什么,小孩,", "end": 556.85}, {"start": 556.85, "text": "那好多child怎么说呢,", "end": 558.69}, {"start": 558.69, "text": "children,", "end": 559.65}, {"start": 559.65, "text": "有人就说了,", "end": 560.85}, {"start": 560.85, "text": "为什么不是childs,", "end": 563.7}, {"start": 563.7, "text": "对,你的理解是正确的,", "end": 565.62}, {"start": 565.62, "text": "但我说过什么,", "end": 566.98}, {"start": 566.98, "text": "只要一个东西尾音是nnn,", "end": 569.46}, {"start": 569.46, "text": "你就知道它是德语过来的,", "end": 571.54}, {"start": 571.54, "text": "不信你们去看一句德语的话,", "end": 573.86}, {"start": 573.86, "text": "你看不懂德语也罢,", "end": 575.62}, {"start": 575.62, "text": "但是你发现好多词的结尾都是n,", "end": 578.42}, {"start": 578.42, "text": "对吧,", "end": 579.22}, {"start": 579.22, "text": "所